fps and FAVG = 1..0 fps) rendezvous tfajectories ffom locations 1000 ftaway in directions I through 5 as: def ined [n Figure 2.. For example,the coordinates of a polnr 1000 ft eway- in direction 2 would be OO7,7O7)ifor d[rectton 5 they would he (0,-IOOO). Trajectot'ies f rom Y = -1000 ft(dir.ection 5) are presented in addition to Y = +1000 f t (direction I )

