82
V ITA
Ronald Lafe Farris was born in Austin, Texas on August 2, l95l+,the son of Jack D. Farris and Ruth A. Farris. Upon retiring from theAir Force in 1955, Mr. Farris moved his family to Uvalde, Texas whereRon and his older sister Jane graduated from high school. Ron attendedthe University of Texas at Austin from September 1972 until August 1977,when he received a Bachelor of Science Degree in Aerospace Engineering.As an undergraduate, Ron worked as a student engineer at Bell HelicopterCompany in Fort Worth, Texas. This was done through the Co-operativeEngineering Program at The University of Texas whereby the student al-ternates semesters of classwork at UT with semesters of practical en-gineering experience.Ron was married to Barbara Kay Burchard of Austin, Texas onJanuary 8, 1977. He officially entered graduate school in Septemberof 1977 and received his Master of Science Degree in Aerospace Engineer-ing in May, 1978.
Permanent Address: Rockspri ngsUvalde, TX
Route7880 r
This thesis was typed by Barbara K. Farris.

